WEBVTT

00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:09.653
Inventory keeps stock at each location up to date, and tells you what to order. In this video, you’ll check stock, log a delivery, and see the suggestions.

00:00:10.675 --> 00:00:17.928
Open Inventory. Every item shows how fast it’s used and how many days are left, with low and out items flagged.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:25.398
Keep it current with one tap: Count, Received, or Waste. Here, three cartons of oat milk just arrived.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:33.097
Count mode walks you through the walk-in, shelf by shelf. Or just tell Assist, we got four cases of tomatoes.

00:00:34.118 --> 00:00:44.358
Worklynq reads what sold in Square and Order Tracking, works out daily usage through your menu links, and suggests what to order from each supplier, and where to set your pars.

00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:49.359
And Profit shows which dishes earn the most, and which ones need a new price.
